Query Answering Using a HENN Graph . During the query time,
given a query point 𝑞∈R𝑑, the goal is to find the approximate
nearest neighbor of 𝑞within𝑋. We follow the greedy search al-
gorithm on top of HENN graph: Starting from a random node in
the root (layerL𝐿), we find the nearest neighbor of 𝑞within this
layer by following a simple greedy search algorithm [ 46,47]. After
