4 Theoretical Analysis
In this section, we analyze the query-time complexity of the HENN
structure with respect to the black-box choice of the underlying
proximity graph (PG) and the value of 𝜀specified in Equation 1. We
begin by introducing the preliminary concepts needed to establish
the final time bound.
